id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9479::$$$message_0071_0000_0000$$$::I finish my lunch and walk around the school in the afternoon.[lr]::
9480::$$$message_0071_0000_0001$$$::It's a weekend, but there are figures here and there in the hallway.[lr]::
9481::$$$message_0071_0000_0002$$$::It must be the students working hard at their club activities. There's no doubt the other building where the music room or the art room is more lively.::
9482::$$$message_0071_0001_0000$$$::I look back for some reason.[lr]::
9483::$$$message_0071_0001_0001$$$::There's nothing in particular that catches my eye.[lr]::
9484::$$$message_0071_0001_0002$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
9485::$$$message_0071_0001_0003$$$::What's strange is that there was no reason at all to look back.::
9486::$$$message_0071_0002_0000$$$::I suddenly feel like drinking tea, so I head to the student council room.[lr]::
9487::$$$message_0071_0002_0001$$$::When I peer into the classroom from the hallway, I see some students.[lr]::
9488::$$$message_0071_0002_0002$$$::The hallway isn't completely silent.[lr]::
9489::$$$message_0071_0002_0003$$$::Behind me is just quiet. As I'm walking, I hear people's voices ahead of me but...[lr]::
9490::$$$message_0071_0002_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
9491::$$$message_0071_0002_0005$$$::The hallway when I look behind me is quiet like it exists in a different world.::
9492::$$$message_0071_0003_0000$$$::"...Why did I look behind me...?"[lr]::
9493::$$$message_0071_0003_0001$$$::There's nothing in particular that catches my eye.[lr]::
9494::$$$message_0071_0003_0002$$$::There's no reason to look behind me.[lr]::
9495::$$$message_0071_0003_0003$$$::It would make sense if I had some reason like having the chills, but just looking ambiguously behind me is eerie.::
9496::$$$message_0071_0004_0000$$$::They say that scary stories are trending, but depending on how you see it, wouldn't this be considered a scary story too?[lr]::
9497::$$$message_0071_0004_0001$$$::A mystery where things behind me bother me for no reason.::
9498::$$$message_0071_0005_0000$$$::"Well, I guess you could say this is typical for a school around this time of year."[lr]::
9499::$$$message_0071_0005_0001$$$::Exams are near, and there are a lot of students that are mentally sensitive.[lr]::
9500::$$$message_0071_0005_0002$$$::There are a lot of things to think about during these four days, and I might just be tired without realizing it.::
9501::$$$message_0071_0006_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I should just go home and rest."[lr]::
9502::$$$message_0071_0006_0001$$$::I can go to the student council room another time.[lr]::
9503::$$$message_0071_0006_0002$$$::I walk through the hallway. [seloop storage=se318.wav]I restrain myself from wanting to look back many times and leave school.::
909479::$$$message_9071_0000_0000$$$::I finish my lunch and walk around the school in the afternoon.[r]Ïys